  "description": "For the last twenty two years, we've been making the gear we want to wear and the bikes we want to ride. The Standard Ti 3X2 is no exception. We've combined the best aspects of the Twin Six Standard Ti 29/FSU singletrack slayer and our gravel machine, the Standard Ti Rando. The Standard Ti 3X2 is a 32 inch beast that can be set up for gravel or mountain, using either drop or flat bars. You can't help but smile as you float over chunky gravel, washboard, roots and rocks. This beautiful titanium frame is both snappy and compliant. It grips on the uphills, soars on the downhills and carves corners like your favorite XC rig. We are very excited to add the Standard Ti 3X2 to the Twin Six fleet.\n\nThe Standard Ti 3X2 Frame includes a Wolf Tooth rear axle, Wolf Tooth seatpost clamp and UDH derailleur hanger.",
